id": "3393168994198951", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499627502_3393168997532284_4012274785949412253_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pqFdMJ4-GZ4Q7kNvwGKm3oD&_nc_oc=AdoTdmtQh_MEEGPhVj9W3BdIEHolHWya-S2OajpmkwWoKbhX5PycXU8-4Nm0onLilfY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTF7o1ag4ADUZePpDgaqAhDNjkHY65HM2pCSchnMA8Csg&oe=6AEC9D32"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "title.png", "id": "1097778122900602", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593761155_1097778126233935_3172726427822974132_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FHwfB0RweUsQ7kNvwEZlios&_nc_oc=AdrinCHdtmPoPE-uVBkgiDs7HNFex6peuuVGqcpU8fk525y-8WHDhBv6o6Dqe3oj1jU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ5Lj2o9Wj0xg0sihxVdDAsjlWJLbTAZsuMr21Zd7MkEA&oe=6AEC95FE"}, "display_name": "Media Review", "keywords": ["creative", "review", "videos", "collaborative", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "**Media Review** is a collaborative VR video review tool for the Meta Quest. Watch footage together in real-time with frame-accurate synced playback across user headsets.\n\n## **FRAME .IO INTEGRATION**\nBrowse your Frame projects, download assets directly to your headset, and create shared review rooms. Post timestamped comments and draw annotations on-screen \u2014 all synced back to Frame.io.\n\n## **SYNCED MULTIPLAYER**\nUp to 16 participants watch simultaneously with sub-second sync. Hosts control playback and guest permissions. Built-in voice chat keeps the conversation going, and networked laser pointers let everyone point at what matters.\n\n## **PROFESSIONAL TRANSPORT**\nSingle-frame stepping, jog scrub via thumb stick, and three timecode formats (standard, frame count, SMPTE). Adjustable playback speed and playlist support with drag-to-reorder.\n\n## **STEREOSCOPIC PLAYBACK**\nSupports rectilinear, 180 and 360 (all in mono and stereo, both over under and side-by-side).", "short_description": "Review videos together in VR! Media Review syncs playback across all headsets so teams can watch, discuss, and annotate content simultaneously \u2014 whether streaming from Frame.io or playing local files.\n\n- Frame.io integration - downloads, comments and drawn annotations\n- Synced playback (for up to 20 users)\n- Image Controls - like color, convergence and crop controls\n- Frame-accurate transport with SMPTE timecode\n- Voice chat and networked laser pointer\n- Speech-to-text notes with timecode stamps"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meta RLE", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://watchparty.cf.metafb.cloud/site/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["CO_OP", "MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "35465330823115185"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4591072211104835"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "4591072211104835"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1789495200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4591072211104835"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binar